  "body": "## Goal\nCorrect the map-only planning board: remove the inaccurate lower roulette/storyboard panels and make the Veil side structurally match the Ward side.\n\n## Confirmed grammar\nOne Ward Citadel branches into three fronts. One Veil Citadel branches back into the same three fronts. Every front reads:\nWard Citadel -> Ward forward base -> contested clash zone -> Veil forward base -> Veil Citadel.\n\n## Boundaries\n- This removes only the lower images from the planning board.\n- The 3x3 roulette system and lower control deck remain retained gameplay/UI contracts.\n- No Godot code, Scene, Resource, or runtime asset is changed.\n\n## Acceptance\n- Board contains no lower UI/storyboard strip.\n- Exactly one Ward home citadel and one Veil home citadel are visible.\n- All three fronts visibly include both factions' forward bases and one clash zone.",
